      ],
      "text_preview": "2 The above Writ Petition is filed seeking to quash and set aside the impugned order dated 8 th July, 2024 passed by Respondent Nos. 2 & 3."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "b42ad4d689bd45b1ae9d0b922c3a1f11_12",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "3. According to the Petitioner, the above order is wholly unwarranted and contrary to the provisions of law."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "10e71b5e0d1b427d8a55fb53f4524d62_13",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "According to the Petitioner, there is no provision under the Food Safety and Standards Act,\n2006 or any Regulations framed thereunder which prohibits the storage or sale of non-food items in the same premises as food items."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "59112c988fb9439d855e2a2fd302476d_15",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "\nFurther, the FSSAI Handbook also states that where food and non-food items are transported in the same vehicle, they must be suitably segregated to prevent cross-contamination and non-food items must be stored separately."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "5b3dc70cb58d42cea2e7b11bb6ea7c93_16",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "It is the case of the Petitioner that where the legislation wished to regulate the storage of food and non-food items, it has to be done in specific provisions and which are being complied with by the Petitioner."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "ad32d680e48b409c844b590ba9aec2a2_17",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "However, there is no blanket prohibition on storage of food and non-food items in the same JULY 15, 2024 S.R.JOSHI 6-wp-9890-2024.doc premises, is the argument."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "d8148393d9c444f48491ffe115948af3_18",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "Further, even the license granted to the Petitioner, does not include any such prohibition."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "14eba4895aea4f63a3b76eae27ee917b_19",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "It is also the case of the Petitioner that food and non-food items are stored separately i.e. on different racks/ shelves in the licensed premises."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "841fb09b542c4377afef357c95ce4fdb_20",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "RATIO"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "For all these reasons and more, it the case of the Petitioner that the impugned order is unsustainable."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "bc0ce34225174b43b3c7783673c8610c_21",
      "summary_section": "decision",
      "labels": [
        "RPC"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:decision",
        "forbidden_labels:RPC",
        "suspicious_label:rpc"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "\n4. Today when the matter is called out, Mr. Misra, appears on behalf of Respondent No.1 and waives notice."
